[00:00.70]Bless us as we meet together,
[00:06.46]O Jehovah, we now pray.
[00:12.80]We are thankful for our meetings;
[00:19.14]May your spirit with us stay.
[00:26.80]Help us, Lord, refine our worship;
[00:31.05]With your Word, oh, do us fill.
[00:34.04]Train our minds and tongues to witness;
[00:38.38]Love within our hearts instill.
[00:41.91]Loving Father, bless our meetings;
[00:45.71]Grant us peace and unity.
[00:48.42]May our words and may our actions
[01:29.54]Magnify your Sov’reignty.
